stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Present: cursor at verified EOF
    Present --> Present: optional append beyond durable cursor
    Present --> Missing: external archive removes original
    Missing --> Retired: retained FD verifies durable EOF
    Missing --> Halted: missing proof or unread tail
    Retired --> Retired: restart retains retirement
    Retired --> Attached: valid B binds while ready
    Halted --> NewBinding: valid readable B binds
    NewBinding --> Resuming: same host consumes B evidence once
    Resuming --> Halted: before repair archive blocks historical park
    Resuming --> Parked: after repair historical A parks without retirement
    Parked --> Attached: ready actor follows B
